OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F389A1785152167
OL,3,CTakeaway closed after mouse infestation
OL,5,FA Chinese takeaway has been closed in
OL,6,FPortsmouth after food hygiene
OL,7,Finspectors found an active mouse
OL,8,Finfestation.
OL,10,FThe routine inspection of Copnor
OL,11,FTakeaway by the council's
OL,12,Fenvironmental health team found
OL,13,Fdroppings on food storage shelves,
OL,14,Fnext to open food in boxes of onions
OL,15,Fand sacks of rice.
OL,17,FThe structure of the premises on
OL,18,FCopnor Road was found to be poor, with
OL,19,Fa large gap under the rear door
OL,20,Fallowing rodent entry.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/4
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
