CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F389A1785152167
OL,3,CTakeaway closed after mouse infestation
OL,5,FOfficials said there were glue boards
OL,6,Fin the storeroom indicating that the
OL,7,Fpremises knew about the issue. There
OL,8,Fwere also issues with cleanliness and
OL,9,Fdirty chopping boards were found.
OL,11,FCouncillor Lee Hunt, Cabinet Member
OL,12,Ffor Community Safety, Leisure & Sport,
OL,13,Fsaid:
OL,15,F"This swift result shows that we will
OL,16,Ftake the strongest possible action to
OL,17,Fstop businesses operating in unsafe
OL,18,Fand unhygienic ways.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/4
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
