FL,390,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F389A1785152167
OL,3,CTakeaway closed after mouse infestation
OL,5,F"The conditions found at Copnor
OL,6,FTakeaway posed are very serious risk
OL,7,Fto people's health, and it will remain
OL,8,Fclosed until the business meets the
OL,9,Fcorrect hygiene standards that all
OL,10,Ffood and drink sellers a required to
OL,11,Fshow."
OL,13,FThe business was immediately closed at
OL,14,Fthe time of the inspection, on July
OL,15,F20th, under a Hygiene Emergency
OL,16,FProhibition Notice.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/4
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
