CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F389A1785152167
OL,3,CTakeaway closed after mouse infestation
OL,5,FPortsmouth Magistrate's Court agreed
OL,6,Fwith the council's actions and on 22
OL,7,FJuly signed a Hygiene Emergency
OL,8,FProhibition Order, keeping the
OL,9,Fbusiness closed until the health risk
OL,10,Fhas been removed.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/4
